WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to Flood Basics. In this lesson, we explain what causes floods.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Floods can be caused by heavy rain, river overflow, or storm surge.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Learn how to recognize early warning signs and prepare safely.
